        ]
      },
      "level": {
        "value": 5
      },
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>Tactics</strong> Caballus casts <em>mystic armor</em> before the fight (one rank 1 slot; apply @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.qkwb5DD3zmKwvbk0]{Spell Effect: Mystic Armor}, which raises his AC to 21). He opens with <em>fireball</em>, then casts <em>slow</em> on the closest melee threat. He uses <em>blazing bolt</em> on casters and <em>blur</em> when engaged, and he stays behind his goblin screen to keep Meat Shield available.</p>\n<p><strong>Loot</strong> @UUID[Compendium.cerabonds-degrees-of-success.icewind-dale-2-items.Item.4xl7YMJALjkDTpdW]{Whispering Staff}, 4d6 gp (14 gp in his inventory), a pouch of goblin teeth.</p>",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Caballus is the goblin sorcerer whose name the goblins chant, and the third prong of the assault on Targos. He is cruel and theatrical, and he cheerfully burns his own troops. A pyre ward of goblin sorcery shields him, granting him resistance 5 to fire.</p>",
